{{Quote|Somewhere below is where our ancient capital once stood.|[[Bo-Katan Kryze]]|<ref name="The Spies">{{TheMandalorian|Chapter 23: The Spies}}</ref>}}
'''Keldabe''' was the former [[capital]] [[city]] of the [[planet]] [[Mandalore]]<ref name="Fact File" /> in ancient times. The [[Great Forge]] was located beneath the [[city]].<ref name="Mando VG" />

Around [[42 BBY]],<ref name="Date Note">According to {{FactFile2014|98|MAN 1-4|Mandalore}}, the [[Great Clan Wars|Mandalorian Civil War]] took place around 20 [[Standard year|years]] before the [[Clone Wars]]. As ''[[Star Wars: Galactic Atlas]]'' dates the beginning of the [[Cloning|Clone]] Wars to the year [[22 BBY]], it can be determined that the [[Mandalorian]] Civil War took place circa [[42 BBY]].</ref> the city was devastated during the [[Great Clan Wars|Mandalorian Civil War]], a [[Standard year|year]]-long conflict fought between the [[New Mandalorians|New Mandalorian]] peace movement and Mandalore's [[martial traditionalists]]. When the New [[Mandalorian]]s won the war, they shifted the planet's capital from Keldabe to the city of [[Sundari]], their center of influence.<ref name="Fact File" /> Following the [[liberation of Mandalore]], [[Bo-Katan Kryze]] restarted the Great Forge beneath the ruins of the ancient Keldabe capital.<ref name="Mando VG" />

The city shared its name with [[Keldabe kiss]].<ref name="FTL">''[[Friends Like These]]''</ref>
